    <notepad>
      <note>Stream A → etl_dq_rule_result_details (row-level rejects + warnings)
Stream B → etl_dq_rule_result_analysis (aggregate counts per rule)
Stream C → stg_divvy_trips (clean rows, cast, deduplicated)</note>
